{"page":440,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"434","words":[{"text":"434","x":174,"y":130,"width":80,"height":37}]},{"text":"CHAPTER06 • 링크 계층: 링크, 접속망, 랜","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER06","x":563,"y":133,"width":165,"height":27},{"text":"•","x":760,"y":140,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"링크","x":805,"y":135,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"계층:","x":867,"y":134,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"링크,","x":941,"y":134,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"접속망,","x":1016,"y":133,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"랜","x":1119,"y":133,"width":25,"height":29}]},{"text":"ARP 프로토콜에는 주목한 만한 홍미로운 점이 두 가지 있다. 첫째, 질의 ARP 메","words":[{"text":"ARP","x":604,"y":267,"width":73,"height":28},{"text":"프로토콜에는","x":690,"y":262,"width":198,"height":37},{"text":"주목한","x":901,"y":259,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"만한","x":1013,"y":260,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"홍미로운","x":1095,"y":259,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"점이","x":1248,"y":259,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"두","x":1329,"y":260,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"가지","x":1379,"y":257,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"있다.","x":1467,"y":259,"width":79,"height":39},{"text":"첫째,","x":1565,"y":260,"width":80,"height":39},{"text":"질의","x":1664,"y":259,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"ARP","x":1747,"y":264,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"메","x":1834,"y":263,"width":27,"height":38}]},{"text":"시지는 브로드캐스트 프레임으로 전송되는 반면에, 응답 ARP 메시지는 표준 프레임","words":[{"text":"시지는","x":541,"y":321,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"브로드캐스트","x":653,"y":322,"width":198,"height":36},{"text":"프레임으로","x":866,"y":319,"width":166,"height":39},{"text":"전송되는","x":1051,"y":319,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"반면에,","x":1200,"y":320,"width":114,"height":38},{"text":"응답","x":1331,"y":318,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"ARP","x":1419,"y":324,"width":81,"height":29},{"text":"메시지는","x":1519,"y":321,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"표준","x":1682,"y":323,"width":72,"height":35},{"text":"프레임","x":1769,"y":322,"width":91,"height":39}]},{"text":"으로 전송된다는 점이다. 왜 이렇게 하는지 그 이유를 한 번 생각해 보라. 둘째, ARP","words":[{"text":"으로","x":537,"y":383,"width":66,"height":29},{"text":"전송된다는","x":621,"y":381,"width":163,"height":38},{"text":"점이다.","x":800,"y":379,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"왜","x":920,"y":379,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"이렇게","x":969,"y":379,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"하는지","x":1084,"y":379,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1201,"y":386,"width":35,"height":26},{"text":"이유를","x":1253,"y":380,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":1372,"y":379,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"번","x":1425,"y":380,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"생각해","x":1477,"y":381,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"보라.","x":1603,"y":383,"width":80,"height":38},{"text":"둘째,","x":1702,"y":382,"width":78,"height":38},{"text":"ARP","x":1797,"y":386,"width":67,"height":32}]},{"text":"는 플러그 앤 플레이이다. 즉, 노드의 ARP 테이블이 지동으로 구축된다는 점이다. 시","words":[{"text":"는","x":536,"y":442,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"플러그","x":584,"y":440,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"앤","x":698,"y":441,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"플레이이다.","x":743,"y":439,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"즉,","x":932,"y":441,"width":41,"height":36},{"text":"노드의","x":989,"y":440,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"ARP","x":1105,"y":445,"width":74,"height":28},{"text":"테이블이","x":1195,"y":440,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"지동으로","x":1351,"y":440,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"구축된다는","x":1510,"y":443,"width":185,"height":37},{"text":"점이다.","x":1713,"y":441,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"시","x":1836,"y":446,"width":25,"height":37}]},{"text":"스템 관리자가 테이블을 구성하지 않아도 된다. 그리고 호스트가 서브넷으로부터 연결","words":[{"text":"스템","x":536,"y":501,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"관리자가","x":615,"y":500,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"테이블을","x":761,"y":500,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"구성하지","x":905,"y":499,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"않아도","x":1052,"y":501,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"된다.","x":1167,"y":501,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"그리고","x":1259,"y":502,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"호스트가","x":1379,"y":503,"width":146,"height":37},{"text":"서브넷으로부터","x":1540,"y":502,"width":247,"height":39},{"text":"연결","x":1806,"y":504,"width":57,"height":39}]},{"text":"이 끊어지면, 이 호스트에 대한 엔트리는 그 서브넷의 다른 ARP 테이블에서 결국은","words":[{"text":"이","x":537,"y":561,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"끊어지면,","x":584,"y":561,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":744,"y":561,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"호스트에","x":792,"y":560,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"대한","x":940,"y":559,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"엔트리는","x":1023,"y":561,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"그","x":1174,"y":567,"width":35,"height":26},{"text":"서브넷의","x":1226,"y":562,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":1384,"y":562,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"ARP","x":1473,"y":568,"width":81,"height":29},{"text":"테이블에서","x":1573,"y":564,"width":177,"height":38},{"text":"결국은","x":1773,"y":563,"width":93,"height":39}]},{"text":"제거된다.","words":[{"text":"제거된다.","x":537,"y":622,"width":139,"height":38}]},{"text":"ARP가 링크 계층 프로토콜인지 또는 네트워크 계층 프로토콜인지 궁금할 것이","words":[{"text":"ARP가","x":600,"y":684,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"링크","x":727,"y":683,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"계층","x":808,"y":682,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜인지","x":889,"y":682,"width":199,"height":39},{"text":"또는","x":1108,"y":685,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"네트워크","x":1195,"y":684,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"계층","x":1355,"y":685,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜인지","x":1443,"y":685,"width":215,"height":37},{"text":"궁금할","x":1680,"y":685,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"것이","x":1807,"y":686,"width":55,"height":39}]},{"text":"다. 앞서 살펴본 것처럼 ARP 패킷은 링크 계층 프레임에 캡슐화되며, 따라서 구조적","words":[{"text":"다.","x":535,"y":744,"width":40,"height":37},{"text":"앞서","x":593,"y":744,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"살펴본","x":675,"y":744,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"것처럼","x":791,"y":742,"width":93,"height":39},{"text":"ARP","x":902,"y":747,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"패킷은","x":992,"y":743,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"링크","x":1110,"y":744,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"계층","x":1194,"y":745,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"프레임에","x":1277,"y":746,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"캡슐화되며,","x":1438,"y":746,"width":190,"height":38},{"text":"따라서","x":1647,"y":746,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"구조적","x":1770,"y":747,"width":92,"height":38}]},{"text":"으로 링크 계층보다 위에 있다. 그러나 ARP 패킷은 링크 계층 주소를 포함하는 필드","words":[{"text":"으로","x":534,"y":807,"width":67,"height":30},{"text":"링크","x":618,"y":805,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"계층보다","x":698,"y":804,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"위에","x":845,"y":803,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":927,"y":803,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"그러나","x":1015,"y":804,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"ARP","x":1131,"y":810,"width":77,"height":28},{"text":"패킷은","x":1224,"y":806,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"링크","x":1347,"y":807,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"계층","x":1434,"y":807,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"주소를","x":1520,"y":809,"width":112,"height":36},{"text":"포함하는","x":1646,"y":807,"width":144,"height":37},{"text":"필드","x":1807,"y":808,"width":58,"height":36}]},{"text":"들이 있기 때문에 링크 계층 프로토콜이라고 주장할 수도 있지만, 네트워크 계층 주소","words":[{"text":"들이","x":532,"y":865,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"있기","x":615,"y":865,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"때문에","x":695,"y":865,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"링크","x":810,"y":865,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"계층","x":889,"y":864,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜이라고","x":967,"y":866,"width":238,"height":37},{"text":"주장할","x":1218,"y":867,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"수도","x":1339,"y":868,"width":71,"height":36},{"text":"있지만,","x":1428,"y":868,"width":115,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":1561,"y":868,"width":145,"height":37},{"text":"계층","x":1724,"y":868,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"주소","x":1805,"y":870,"width":60,"height":35}]},{"text":"도 포함하기 때문에 네트워크 계층 프로토콜이라고도 할 수 있다. 결론은 ARP는 링","words":[{"text":"도","x":531,"y":930,"width":35,"height":27},{"text":"포함하기","x":580,"y":926,"width":131,"heigh